<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.09 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.09 vs   0.01</p>
